    <img src="https://images.code.org/f6f049b0e8d02240d84d6429bee372b2-image-1774452696872.png" alt="Letter E" style="width: 20%; max-width: 120px; height: auto; border-radius: 12px;">
    <div style="flex: 1; background: #f7f8fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font-size: 14pt;">
      <h3><b>Explore</b></h3>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt;">Look at two different versions of a feature and compare how each one works.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 18px; background-color: #F5F7F8; padding: 10px; border-left: 5px solid #8148B2; display: inline-block;">
        🔍 “What are two ways I could build a filter?”
      </p>
