      <p style="font-size: 14pt;">Build the feature with AI by asking questions, testing ideas, and making changes together.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 18px; background-color: #F5F7F8; padding: 10px; border-left: 5px solid #8148B2; display: inline-block;">
        🤝 “Help me make this filter work step by step.”
