## Applying the ECHO Framework

#### Students will use the ECHO framework to study filter patterns by comparing examples, building with AI, identifying good coding practices, and then creating their own solution.

#### This process helps students learn from examples without copying blindly. Instead, they test ideas, reflect on what works, and use that understanding to write code independently.

#### As students work with larger data sets and more advanced programs, a process like ECHO can help them use AI as a learning partner while still taking ownership of their code.

## Try it out

#### Think of the ECHO framework as you work through the next level. 
